[Desktop Entry]
Name=进入 Denial 手柄桌面
Name[en]=Enter Denial Gamepad Desktop
Comment=切换到 Denial 手柄桌面（全屏触摸手势）
Comment[en]=Switch to the Denial gamepad desktop with full-screen touch gestures
Exec=/usr/bin/denial-tablet-session-select gamepad denial-gamepad.desktop
TryExec=/usr/bin/denial-tablet-session-select
